            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Meant to Live"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(occult, necromancy)\n\nWhenever an unrisen would take damage from positive energy, it instead heals half that number of Hit Points."
            },
            "id": "d4a0709c-61c7-49ec-864f-bd6f6a1b863b",
