            "action_name": {
              "value": "Awful Approach"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The unrisen reshapes its grotesque form to move swiftly. It Strides twice. Any living creature that can see the unrisen during this movement must succeed at a 28 Fortitude save or be sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). This is a mental and visual effect. The unrisen can't use Awful Approach again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
